                <pb facs="0144" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1927v03/pg42"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.51/589: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Geissler</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-05-31T11:00:00-07:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 31, 1927—11
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 3:10 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>51. The Assembly yesterday approved the railway debt settlement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geissler</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
